b51f9005662744e3096d6076c4a75ca.600x338.jpg?t=1771714707"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443770/ss_ce01988ad01e435fc563094092e82533a4ee7a48.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771714707","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443770/ss_ce01988ad01e435fc563094092e82533a4ee7a48.600x338.jpg?t=1771714707"}],"short_description":"You inherit your dad\u2019s beaten up car and rebuild it piece by piece, swapping engine parts, upgrading the suspension, fitting new wheels and more until it becomes a high performance race car. Beat your opponents and earn revenge for your dad.","steam_appid":2443770,"support_info":{"email":"noongames01@gmail.com","url":"noon.games"},"supported_languages":"English, German, Polish, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain","type":"game","website":null}